 "remarks": "Beautiful corner unit overlooking the Five Mile River in desirable Carriage House, ideally situated on the West Norwalk/Darien border. This bright two-bedroom, two-full-bath residence features an open floor plan, 9-foot ceilings, updated flooring, and abundant natural light. The bright, spacious kitchen features ample cabinetry and counter space and flows seamlessly into the living and dining areas. The spacious primary bedroom includes a walk-in closet and private full bathroom, while the second bedroom provides flexibility for guests or a home office. Additional highlights include two designated parking spaces, storage on the garage level, and controlled-access entry. New HVAC system installed in December 2025. Easy access to shopping, dining, I-95, the Merritt Parkway, and multiple Metro-North train stations.",
